And narrated to us Abu Kurayb, he said: Abu Khalid informed us.

And narrated to us 'Abdullah ibn Sa'id al-Ashajj, he said: Ibn Idris informed me.

And narrated to us Muhammad ibn Ma'mar, he said: Muhammad — meaning Ibn Bakr — informed us, all of them from Ibn Jurayj, who said: Abu az-Zubayr informed me that he heard Jabir ibn 'Abdullah saying:

